<title>HONG KONG: HK evening newspaper leaks 1997/98 budget details.</title>
<headline>HK evening newspaper leaks 1997/98 budget details.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A pro-Beijing newspaper, the New Evening Post, said Hong Kong's Financial Secretary Donald Tsang would reveal a 1996/97 budget surplus of HK$15 billion and would forecast a surplus of HK$32 billion for 1997/98 in his budget speech on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The paper was published before Tsang stood up to give his budget speech at 2.30 p.m. (0630 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6352</p>
